# Project Bootstrap

- Use `AGENTS.md` as the canonical repository index.
- This is a Maven multi-module core library; live implementation is in `declaracoes-gov-core-*/src` and the related `pom.xml` files.
- Keep the core framework-agnostic and declaration-agnostic.
- `mvn -q verify` is the validation gate.
